  <h2>Civilization Maintenance</h2>
  <p>
    This is the core concept behind the Techno Park — and arguably the most important idea on this entire
    website. The question is not "can we buy everything we need?" but <strong>"what is the minimum technology
    stack required to maintain a modern quality of life, and can we build and repair it ourselves?"</strong>
  </p>
  <p>
    Six capabilities define the boundary between a community that survives and one that thrives:
    <strong>electricity, clean water, communications, basic medical, food production, and fabrication.</strong>
    If you can maintain all six from locally available materials and knowledge, you have chosen your
    civilization level — and no supply chain disruption, political crisis, or economic collapse can take it away.
  </p>

