          <th class="py-3 pr-4 font-display font-semibold text-bark-800">Technology</th>
          <th class="py-3 font-display font-semibold text-bark-800">Self-Maintainable?</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody class="text-bark-600">
        <tr class="border-b border-bark-200">
